@startuml admin-gdpr-reports
!include admin-common.puml
title Rapports de conformité RGPD

== Rapports conformité RGPD ==
Admin -> Frontend: Générer rapport RGPD
Frontend -> API: GET /api/admin/compliance/gdpr
API -> Auth: Vérifier permissions admin
Auth --> API: access granted

API -> AdminCtrl: generateGDPRReport()
AdminCtrl -> UserSvc: getPersonalDataReport()

par Données utilisateurs
    UserSvc -> DB: SELECT users WITH personal_data_fields
    DB --> UserSvc: user data summary
else Consentements
    UserSvc -> DB: SELECT user_consents WITH types, dates
    DB --> UserSvc: consent data
else Suppressions
    UserSvc -> DB: SELECT deleted_users WITH deletion_reason, date
    DB --> UserSvc: deletion data
end

UserSvc -> UserSvc: Generate compliance report
UserSvc -> AuditSvc: logGDPRReportGenerated(adminId)
AuditSvc -> DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs (action: gdpr_report_generated)

UserSvc --> AdminCtrl: GDPR compliance report
AdminCtrl --> API: compliance data
API --> Frontend: GDPR report
Frontend --> Admin: Rapport de conformité

@enduml